      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说到光电伞蜥，就得提<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>屋顶<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>！\n因为它喜欢光照好的地方。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
