      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想和它一起休息放松，\n所以还希望屋顶上有<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>阳伞<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>和<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>桌椅<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
